     * Timing calculations for fI2CCLK = 170 MHz (tI2CCLK = 5.882 ns):
     * - PRESC = 15 -> tPRESC = (15 + 1) * 5.882 ns = 94.118 ns
     * - SCLL  = 55 -> tSCLL = (55 + 1) * 94.118 ns = 5270.6 ns
     * - SCLH  = 49 -> tSCLH = (49 + 1) * 94.118 ns = 4705.9 ns
