- **Pin Selection**: PC8 (`I2C3_SCL`) and PC9 (`I2C3_SDA`) are multiplexed to AF8. Because the sensor operates at a 1.8 V I/O voltage, the STM32 pins are configured open-drain with internal pull-ups strictly disabled (`PUPDR = 0`) to prevent pulling the bus up to $V_{DD} = 3.3\text{ V}$. External pull-up resistors to the 1.8 V rail provide the high level.
