2. **1.8 V Bus Interfacing**: The pins are set to open-drain (`OTYPER`) with no internal pull-ups (`PUPDR = 0`). Pulling up internally would drag the bus toward $V_{DD} = 3.3\text{ V}$, which exceeds the BME280's 1.8 V maximum ratings. External pull-ups to 1.8 V must handle bus biasing.
