> **Important Hardware Note:** On the STM32G474, **USART1 cannot be mapped to PA2/PA3**. 
> - PA2 and PA3 only support **USART2** (AF7) or **LPUART1** (AF12).
> - USART1 TX/RX pins are available on **PA9/PA10**, **PB6/PB7**, **PC4/PC5**, or **PE0/PE1** (all AF7).
> 
> The code below configures USART1 as requested and sets up PA2/PA3, but note that PA2/PA3 will not physically output/input USART1 signals. If you must use PA2/PA3 without USART2, consider using **LPUART1** (AF12). If using USART1, route TX/RX to pins such as **PA9/PA10**.

