   - For an exact $25\%$ duty cycle in edge-aligned upcounting PWM mode 1:
     $$\text{CCR1} = (\text{ARR} + 1) \times 0.25 = 8500 \times 0.25 = 2125$$
   - This achieves **0.0% frequency error**, **0.0% duty cycle error**, and over **13 bits of resolution**.

