   - Because TIM1 is an advanced motor-control timer, setting `TIM1->BDTR |= TIM_BDTR_MOE` (Main Output Enable) is mandatory to connect the timer output logic to the external pad. Without `MOE = 1`, the PA8 pin remains in its idle/inactive state.
