     * 6. Program I2C_TIMINGR for 100 kHz Standard-mode operation (RM0440 §39.4.9, §39.4.10)
     *
     * Kernel Clock fI2CCLK = SYSCLK = 170000000 Hz -> tI2CCLK = 1 / 170000000 s
     *
     * Prescaler PRESC = 15 (0xF) -> tPRESC = (PRESC + 1) * tI2CCLK = 16 / 170000000 s
     * SCLL = 52 (0x34)           -> tSCLL  = (SCLL + 1) * tPRESC  = 53 * 16 / 170000000 s
     * SCLH = 49 (0x31)           -> tSCLH  = (SCLH + 1) * tPRESC  = 50 * 16 / 170000000 s
     * SDADEL = 2 (0x2)           -> tSDADEL = 2 * tPRESC = 32 / 170000000 s
     * SCLDEL = 4 (0x4)           -> tSCLDEL = (SCLDEL + 1) * tPRESC = 5 * 16 / 170000000 s
     *
