   - To fit the 1 kHz count into a 16-bit register ($170\text{ MHz} / 1\text{ kHz} = 170{,}000 > 65{,}535$), prescaler is set to `3` (divider = 4, $f_{\text{cnt}} = 42.5\text{ MHz}$).
