* **Voltage Scaling (Boost Mode):** To run at $170\text{ MHz}$, the STM32G474 must operate in **Range 1 Boost Mode** ($V_{\text{CORE}}$ boost enabled by clearing `PWR_CR5_R1MODE`, after enabling the PWR peripheral clock).
