  * `SCLDEL = 4` ($500\text{ ns}$ setup time, $> 250\text{ ns}$ spec)
  * `SDADEL = 2` ($200\text{ ns}$ data hold delay)
  * `SCLH = 46` ($4.7\text{ }\mu\text{s}$ high period)
  * `SCLL = 49` ($5.0\text{ }\mu\text{s}$ low period)
  * Total period: $(47 + 50 + t_r/t_f\text{ margin}) \times 100\text{ ns} \approx 10\text{ }\mu\text{s}$.
