     * PRESC = 16  (prescaler divider = 17 -> t_presc = 100 ns)
     * SCLDEL = 4  (data setup time = 500 ns)
     * SDADEL = 2  (data hold time = 200 ns)
     * SCLH = 46   (t_SCLH = 4.7 us)
     * SCLL = 49   (t_SCLL = 5.0 us)
     * TIMINGR = [PRESC:4][RES:4][SCLDEL:4][SDADEL:4][SCLH:8][SCLL:8]
