     * PRESC = 15 -> I2C_CLK = 170 MHz / (15 + 1) = 10.625 MHz (t_presc = 94.12 ns)
     * SCLDEL = 4  -> t_SCLDEL = (4 + 1) * 94.12 ns = 470 ns (> 250 ns standard spec)
     * SDADEL = 2  -> t_SDADEL = 2 * 94.12 ns = 188 ns
     * SCLH   = 51 -> t_HIGH = (51 + 1) * 94.12 ns = 4.89 us
     * SCLL   = 52 -> t_LOW  = (52 + 1) * 94.12 ns = 4.99 us
     * Period = (52 + 53) * 94.12 ns = 9.88 us -> ~101 kHz
